.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/882\r\n* build(deps): bump node from 25-alpine to 26-alpine by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/845\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 4.0.0 to 4.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/855\r\n* build(deps): bump github/codeql-action from 4.35.2 to 4.36.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/862\r\n* build(deps): bump esbuild and tsx by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/863\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6.0.2 to 7.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/867\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump typescript-eslint from 8.59.1 to 8.60.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/857\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump eslint from 10.2.1 to 10.4.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/859\r\n* test: add regression coverage for relaxed header values by @ShogunPanda in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/898\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @savashn made their first contribution in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/868\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/compare/v9.4.3...v9.4.4","mentions_count":4},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/llhttp/releases/362477894","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/llhttp/releases/362477894/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nodejs/llhttp/releases/362477894/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/releases/tag/release/v9.4.3","id":362477894,"author":{"login":"ShogunPanda","id":201101,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTEwMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201101?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShogunPanda","html_url":"https://github.com/ShogunPanda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShogunPanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShogunPanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url"