llhttp/pull/815\r\n* Fix LICENSE by @Dreamsorcerer in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/835\r\n\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 4.2.2 to 5.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/737\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-python from 5.6.0 to 6.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/750\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/cache from 4.2.3 to 4.3.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/760\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump typescript from 5.8.3 to 5.9.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/764\r\n* build(deps): bump node from 24-alpine to 25-alpine by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/775\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-node from 4.4.0 to 6.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/776\r\n* build(deps): bump github/codeql-action from 3.29.11 to 4.31.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/779\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump @stylistic/eslint-plugin from 5.2.2 to 5.5.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/772\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump @types/node from 24.2.0 to 24.9.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/778\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump js-yaml from 4.1.0 to 4.1.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/781\r\n* build(deps): bump minimatch by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/790\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump @types/node from 25.3.0 to 25.3.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/793\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump typescript-eslint from 8.55.0 to 8.56.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/791\r\n* build(deps): bump node from `8099726` to `18e0265` by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/795\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/setup-buildx-action from 3.11.1 to 3.12.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp/pull/796\r\n* build(deps): bump g